{"ref":"BDB, גָּזִית","hw":"גָּזִית","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזִית</span></big>  <strong>n.f. a cutting, hewing</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזִית</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:22\" href=\"/Exodus.20.22\">Ex 20:25</a> + 10 times, always abs.;—<em>hewing</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַבְנֵי ג׳</span> = <em>hewn stones</em> (building-stones) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:31\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.31\">1 K 5:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 22:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.22.2\">1 Ch 22:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:42\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.42\">Ez 40:42</a> (for tables), cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבָנִים יְקָרוֹת כְּמִדּוֹת ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.9\">1 K 7:9</a>,<a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.11\">11</a> (but Klo del. as gloss, cf. 𝔊; also without <span dir=\"rtl\">אבני</span> = <em>hewn stones</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:22\" href=\"/Exodus.20.22\">Ex 20:25</a> (altar) <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:11\" href=\"/Amos.5.11\">Am 5:11</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(בָּֽתֵּי ג׳)</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.9\">Is 9:9</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְבֵנִים</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">טוּרֵי ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:36\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.36\">1 K 6:36</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">טוּרִים ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.12\">7:12</a>; also <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:9\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.9\">La 3:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּדַר דַּרְכִּי בְּג׳</span>.","next":"BDB, גִּזָּה","prev":"BDB, גָּזָה"}